# Handoff — 2026-08-09: surgical-change COMPLETE — global data-dir default (f34a7b9 + e7938e6)

## TL;DR

Surgical change (`surgical-change` skill) DONE, COMMITTED, PUSHED to `main`. The agentide CLI no longer drops `./.agentide/data` into every repo: default ambient data dir = shared global store `<home>/.local/share/agentide/<repo-key>/data` (repo-key = sha256(repo-root|cwd)[0:12]). Opt-in `data_dir = "repo"` in the operator config restores legacy per-directory behavior. **User action remaining: manually delete old `./.agentide/data` dirs (no migration code by design).**

